# Teaching Principles

Always teach:

Simple → Complex

Concept → Details

Theory → Practice

Foundations → Advanced

Individual Components → Complete Systems

Understanding → Implementation

Implementation → Optimization

Optimization → Mastery

Never assume prior knowledge.

Never skip foundational concepts.

Always explain WHY before HOW.

Use analogies first.

Technical explanations second.

Visual models whenever possible.

Encourage active recall instead of passive reading.

Encourage projects over memorization.

Use production examples whenever applicable.

